{"id":"locura","lemma":"locura","pos":"noun","rank":655,"glosses":["madness, craziness","an act of madness (i.e., an act based on a lack of judgement or reasoning; an act causing surprise due to its anomalous nature)","nuts, crazy, insane (translatable as an interjection)"],"ipa":"/loˈkuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"locuras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-locura.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me parece una locura.","en":"I think it's crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448157","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Aquello es una locura.","en":"That's crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300741","words":[{"g":"that one","l":"aquél"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella quiere con locura a su hijo.","en":"She loves her son dearly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639566","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"son"}]},{"text":"Es una locura que pongas tu vida en peligro.","en":"It is crazy of you to put your life at risk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/720973","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"life"},null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"in danger"]]},{"text":"Sería una locura que te quedaras.","en":"You'd be crazy to stay.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540929","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be , to end up","l":"quedar"}]}]}